  "notes": [
    "Complete designation covers the local concentration inventory, not the full CS BS. At least three of five courses must be approved AI courses; the other two may include unused AI courses or other eligible advanced CS courses.",
    "The general advanced-course rule is open: course number 200 or higher, four credits, excluding core/additional math courses listed by the parent degree. It is not an unavailable finite elective list.",
